        "name": "What's the most important factor in front elevation design?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Proportion, how window openings and material zones relate to the building's overall size and shape, matters more than pattern or decoration, and should be resolved before any material decisions are made."
        }
