        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Is mesh or perforated screen design good for a front elevation?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Yes, used selectively over specific zones like a car porch or balcony, mesh design adds texture and light filtering, and where positioned over sun-exposed areas, provides genuine shading benefit as well."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Should the entrance be designed differently from the rest of the front elevation?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Yes, giving the entrance a distinct material or lighting treatment creates a clear focal point and generally produces a stronger overall result than one uniform surface with no obvious point of arrival."
        }
